      "extract": "arXiv:2203.06568v4 [cs.IT] 10 Jun 2023 Semideﬁnite programming bounds for binary codes from a split Terwilliger algebra Pin-Chieh Tseng, Ching-Yi Lai, and Wei-Hsuan Yu Abstract We study the upper bounds for A(n, d), the maximum size of codewords with length n and Hamming distance at least d. Schrijver studied the Terwilliger algebra of the Hamming scheme and proposed a semideﬁnite program to bound A(n, d). We derive",
